Package: tripo3d
Title: Image to 3D Model via Tripo API
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    c(person("Yu", "Gongchao", email = "yugongchao@example.com",
             role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: A lightweight R client for the Tripo 3D generation API.
    Convert images or text prompts into 3D models (GLB format) and
    interactively view them in RStudio, RMarkdown, or Shiny via a
    custom Three.js widget. Built on httr2 for HTTP communication and
    htmlwidgets for 3D rendering.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/yulab-github/tripo3d
